From 0a10ed1da0346a88e6f84376d808e8ba8bb5afba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kk <kaiwalya.khasnis57@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:33:33 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Add RgbLedManager system service

New public API android.hardware.rgbled.RgbLedManager, obtained with
context.getSystemService(Context.RGB_LED_SERVICE). RgbLedService runs in
system_server and forwards calls to the vendor.lineage.rgbled@1.0 HAL.
Mutating calls require the new normal permission
android.permission.CONTROL_RGB_LED.
